  </ul>
  <p>
    India and Singapore don't have an adequacy decision from the European Commission or the UK. The US has one only for
    companies certified under the EU-US Data Privacy Framework and its UK Extension. This is how we protect personal
    data from the EEA and the UK that goes outside them:
  </p>
  <ul>
