      example because you left it or it was deleted, email us and we'll delete your account.
    </li>
    <li>
      Your team can export a job's applications and delete applications and jobs. Admins can delete the whole company.
      Deleting applications and jobs needs an active Plan. Exporting and deleting the company or your account don't.
    </li>
    <li>
