    complain to your local data protection authority.
  </p>

  <h2 id="cookies">11. Cookies and similar technologies</h2>
  <p>The Emploist app uses only strictly necessary cookies:</p>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>Cookie</th>
        <th>What it does</th>
        <th>How long it lasts</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
